aw-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. October to November is the driest pair and came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, January to February came in at 39% of normal and November to December at 48%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 30% of normal.</p>"}
